1. One2many field kya hota hai?
One2many ka matlab hai One record ke saath Multiple records connected hona.

Tumhare project mein:
- Ek Department ke andar multiple Students ho sakte hain.
- Lekin ek Student ek hi Department se belong karega.
Example:
Computer Science Department(One Department)

